/E (To make it easier to work hard, you need to create an environment that doesn't suck. Your brain releases dopamine in response to positive cues like the music playing, the smell of your favorite drink, the comfort of your favorite hoodie or your dog at the end of your bed.  The more cozy your environment is, the less horrible your task will feel. When you take 5 minutes to set up a cozy work environment, you're priming your brain to actually begin!)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
